I still think the safest way to identify those wands is to engrave 
with a weapon until it is dull, then zap that weapon with the wand.  
If the weapon disappears, then the wand is teleportation.  If you can 
engrave with the weapon again, then the wand is cancellation.  If you 
still can't engrave with the weapon, then the wand is mave invisible.

The dungeon is full of weapons the character will never plan on using, 
so it's really easy to do this test.



